#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:576
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1642
msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:578
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, and "
"`--data-parallel-size-local` sets the number of DP ranks on the current "
"node."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size` 设置全局数据并行秩的数量，`--data-parallel-size-local` 设置当前节点上的 DP"
" 秩数量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:579
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` specifies the starting data parallel rank of "
"the current node. Each node must be set to a unique value (e.g., Node0 = 0, "
"Node1 = 1)."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` 指定当前节点的起始数据并行排名。每个节点必须设置为唯一值（例如，节点0 = 0，节点1 = "
"1）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:580
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address` specifies the IP address of the data parallel "
"master node (Node0). It must be consistent across all nodes."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-address` 指定数据并行主节点（节点0）的 IP 地址。所有节点必须保持一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:581
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port` is the DP RPC port. Use the same value on all "
"nodes and ensure the port is available."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port` 是 DP RPC 端口。在所有节点上使用相同的值，并确保该端口可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:582
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. "
"Configure it together with the DP sizes according to the deployment topology"
" and available NPUs."
msgstr ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size` 设置每个 DP 秩内的张量并行大小。根据部署拓扑和可用的 NPU，将其与 DP 大小一起配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:583
msgid ""
"On Ascend 950DT, DeepSeek-V4 does not currently support standalone tensor "
"parallelism (TP-only). TP partitions only the `wq_b`, `wo_a`, and `wo_b` "
"linear layers, so data parallelism is recommended. When TP is required, use "
"it together with DSA-CP and enable FlashComm (`enable_flashcomm1`) and DSA-"
"CP (`enable_dsa_cp`), as in the two-server DeepSeek-V4-Pro mixed deployment."
msgstr ""
"在Ascend "
"950DT上，DeepSeek-V4目前不支持独立的张量并行（仅TP）。TP仅对`wq_b`、`wo_a`和`wo_b`线性层进行切分，因此建议使用数据并行。当需要TP时，请与DSA-"
"CP结合使用，并启用FlashComm（`enable_flashcomm1`）和DSA-"
"CP（`enable_dsa_cp`），如两服务器DeepSeek-V4-Pro混合部署所示。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:584
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not"
" mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer."
msgstr ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。不要在同一个 MoE 层中混合使用 MoE 张量并行和专家并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:585
msgid ""
"`--headless` (used on non-master nodes) disables the API server on the node,"
" since only the master node serves requests."
msgstr "`--headless`（用于非主节点）禁用该节点上的 API 服务器，因为仅主节点处理请求。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:586
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length. Adjust it according "
"to your actual scenario."
msgstr "`--max-model-len` 指定最大上下文长度。请根据实际场景进行调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:587
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group"
" is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service "
"exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and "
"will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also"
" counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing "
"performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-"
"parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs` 表示每个 DP "
"组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，多余的请求将保持等待状态，不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所花费的时间也会计入 TTFT 和 "
"TPOT 等指标中。因此，在测试性能时，通常建议 `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= "
"实际总并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:588
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one "
"scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes "
"more activation memory."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` 是单个调度步骤中处理的最大 token 数。较大的值可以提高 prefill "
"效率，但会消耗更多的激活内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:589
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To "
"enable it, remove this option."
msgstr "`--no-enable-prefix-caching` 表示禁用前缀缓存。要启用它，请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:590
msgid ""
"`--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4K "
"prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`."
msgstr "`--block-size` 设置 KV 缓存块大小。要启用实验性的 4K 前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从 `128` 改为 `32`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:591
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W4A8 model."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend` 为 W4A8 模型启用 Ascend 量化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:592
msgid ""
"`--speculative-config` configures the MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) "
"speculative decoding to accelerate inference."
msgstr "`--speculative-config` 配置 MTP（多令牌预测）推测解码以加速推理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:593
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full ACL graph execution in the decode phase to reduce scheduling latency."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` "
"在解码阶段启用完整的 ACL 图执行，以减少调度延迟。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:594
msgid ""
"`--async-scheduling` enables asynchronous scheduling to overlap CPU "
"scheduling with NPU computation."
msgstr "`--async-scheduling` 启用异步调度，使 CPU 调度与 NPU 计算重叠。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:595
msgid ""
"`--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. "
"`enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, "
"`enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, "
"`enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, "
"`enable_shared_expert_dp` enables data parallelism for shared experts, and "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for "
"better MoE throughput."
msgstr ""
"`--additional-config` 启用 Ascend 特有的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex` 启用增强的 ACL "
"图执行，`enable_static_kernel: false` 保持禁用静态内核编译，`enable_cpu_binding` 启用 Ascend "
"原生 CPU 绑定，`enable_shared_expert_dp` "
"为共享专家启用数据并行，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert` 重叠共享专家计算以提高 MoE 吞吐量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:596
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1` enables the FlashComm communication "
"optimization."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1` 启用 FlashComm 通信优化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:598
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If you encounter issues, please refer to the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html) for "
