#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1335
msgid ""
"This section shows a logical 1P1D deployment on Ascend 950DT servers. The "
"Prefill group uses 4 servers and the Decode group uses 4 servers. Each group"
" contains 32 DP ranks with `DP32/TP1`; every server starts 8 local DP ranks."
" The `prefill` and `decode` settings in `--kv-transfer-config` must "
"therefore both use `dp_size: 32` and `tp_size: 1`."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍在Ascend 950DT服务器上的逻辑1P1D部署。Prefill组使用4台服务器，Decode组使用4台服务器。每个组包含32个DP "
"rank，采用`DP32/TP1`配置；每台服务器启动8个本地DP rank。因此，`--kv-transfer-"
"config`中的`prefill`和`decode`设置都必须使用`dp_size: 32`和`tp_size: 1`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1337
msgid ""
"Before you start, mount `/etc/hixlep/` into the container and complete the "
"following steps:"
msgstr "开始之前，请将`/etc/hixlep/`挂载到容器中，并完成以下步骤："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1441
msgid "Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on each Prefill node."
msgstr "在每个Prefill节点上准备`run_dp_template.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1510
msgid "Prepare `run_dp_template.sh` on each Decode node."
msgstr "在每个Decode节点上准备`run_dp_template.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1580
msgid ""
"Start the server with the following command on each node. Set `local_ip` in "
"`run_dp_template.sh` to the current node IP before starting the service."
msgstr "在每个节点上使用以下命令启动服务器。启动服务前，请将`run_dp_template.sh`中的`local_ip`设置为当前节点IP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1640
msgid ""
"Refer to [Prefill-Decode Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) and "
"register all Prefill and Decode engine endpoints started above. Each node "
"uses ports 8000 through 8007."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[Prefill-"
"Decode分离部署（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)，并注册上述启动的所有Prefill和Decode引擎端点。每个节点使用8000至8007端口。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1644
msgid ""
"`--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager "
"enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the "
"service may OOM during startup."
msgstr ""
"`--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV 缓存管理器处于启用状态。DeepSeek-V4 KV "
"Pool 部署需要此标志；否则，服务在启动期间可能会发生 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1645
msgid ""
"`--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph "
"compilation."
msgstr "`--enforce-eager` 强制在 prefill 节点上使用 eager 执行，而不是图编译。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1646
msgid ""
"`enable_dsa_cp: true` enables DSA context parallelism on prefill nodes. DSA-"
"CP and FlashComm1 must be enabled separately when both are required."
msgstr ""
"`enable_dsa_cp: true` 在 prefill 节点上启用 DSA 上下文并行。当同时需要 DSA-CP 和 FlashComm1 "
"时，必须分别启用它们。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1647
msgid ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on "
"the prefill and decode sides."
msgstr ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 prefill 和 decode 端的实际全局 DP 和 TP 布局匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1648
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`: enables the communication optimization "
"function on the prefill nodes."
msgstr "`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1=1`：在prefill节点上启用通信优化功能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1649
msgid ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: enables the Fused MC2 fusion operator to "
"accelerate communication on prefill nodes (A3 series)."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用Fused MC2融合算子以加速prefill节点（A3系列）上的通信。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1650
msgid ""
"`recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. "
"When the KV Cache of the decode node is insufficient, requests will be sent "
"to the prefill node to recompute the KV Cache. In the PD separation "
"scenario, enable this configuration only on decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当decode节点的KV "
"Cache不足时，请求将被发送至prefill节点重新计算KV Cache。在PD分离场景下，仅在decode节点上启用此配置。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1651
msgid ""
"`MooncakeHybridConnector`: the KV transfer connector used for PD separation,"
" transferring KV Cache between prefill and decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"`MooncakeHybridConnector`：用于PD分离的KV传输连接器，在prefill和decode节点之间传输KV Cache。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1652
msgid ""
"`enable_shared_expert_dp: true`: enables data parallelism for shared "
"experts, applicable to MoE models."
msgstr "`enable_shared_expert_dp: true`：启用共享专家的数据并行，适用于MoE模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1653
msgid ""
"On Ascend 950DT, `ascend_local_comm_res_path` specifies the local "
"communication resource directory used by the KV connector. The directory "
"must be available at the same path in the container."
msgstr ""
"在Ascend "
"950DT上，`ascend_local_comm_res_path`指定KV连接器使用的本地通信资源目录。该目录必须在容器中的相同路径下可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1655
msgid "Deployment Verification:"
msgstr "部署验证："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1657
msgid ""
"After the PD separation service is fully started, send a request through the"
" proxy port on the prefill master node to verify that Prefill and Decode "
"nodes are working correctly together. Refer to [Prefill-Decode "
"Disaggregation "
"(Deepseek)](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"proxy verification method."
msgstr ""
"PD分离服务完全启动后，通过prefill主节点上的代理端口发送请求，验证Prefill和Decode节点是否协同正常工作。代理验证方法请参考[Prefill-"
"Decode分离（Deepseek）](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Pro.md:1659
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If you encounter issues with PD separation deployment, "
"please refer to the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html) for "
"troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：若遇到PD分离部署问题，请参考[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)进行故障排除。"

